/p><p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p><p>LED panel: 504 High-CRI-LEDs<br />Color rendering index: CRI &ge;95<br />Color temperature: 5600 Kelvin<br />Max. illumination: 3500 lux (at 1 m/3 ft)<br />Angle of radiation (half value angle): 85&deg;<br />Panel size:&nbsp;36 x 51 cm (14.2 x 20.1 in)<br />Operating voltage: 100 - 240 V<br />Power consumption: 100 W<br />Fuse: F 4 A<br />Dimensions (WxHxD): 400 x 665 x 47-68 mm&nbsp;(with swivel joint)<br />Weight: approx. 3 kg (6.6 lbs)</p>]]></details>
